8446  E3E7              ; Blocking keyboard input for code running in MMU7.  The resident INKEY
8447  E3E7              ; cannot be used here: its retry path calls gettime, and gettime changes the
8448  E3E7              ; $C000-$FFFF mapping through $7FFD.  Require a full release both before and
8449  E3E7              ; after the key so the H used to open Help is not consumed by the dialog.
8450  E3E7              extra_read_key:
8451  E3E7              .release_before
8452  E3E7 FB                       ei
8453  E3E8 76                       halt
8454  E3E9 CD 4C 80                 call KEYSCAN
